       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    TINVPASS.
       AUTHOR.        FRED HAYNES.
       INSTALLATION.  GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER CO.
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
      ***  >>>>>>>>>>  P O R T A B L E    P R O G R A M  <<<<<<<<<<  ***
      ***------------------------------------------------------------***
       DATE-WRITTEN.  MAY 22, 1984.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.       INVOICE PASSWORD CHECK.
      *           THIS SUBROUTINE IS CALLED BY ALL INVOICING
      *           PROGRAMS TO VERIFY THE USER WITH A GIVEN 'USER ID'
      *           CAN RUN THE INVOICE PROGRAM.  THIS CHECK IS BASED
      *           SOLELY ON AN ENTRY BY 'USER ID' IN MCFL000201/INVPWFIL.DB.

      *C  11/17/1997     CA YODER
      *C     INCREASED PASSWORD SIZE FROM 6 TO 7 SO THAT USERS CAN USE
      *C     THEIR 7-CHARACTER MAINFRAME PASSWORD.
      *C
      *C  03/12/1998     CA YODER
      *C     INCREASED PASSWORD SIZE FROM 7 TO 8 AFTER FINDING OUT THAT
      *C     THE MAINFRAME PASSWORD IS 8 CHARACTERS.

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       COPY SPECIALN IN COPYLIB.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT INVPWFIL-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFL000201
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                   ACCESS MODE IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZINVPASS-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
      *------ FOR IBM ONLY ------*
       FD  INVPWFIL-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  INVPWFIL-REC-O.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFL000201.

       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                   PIC X(1500).
      *------ FOR IBM ONLY ------*
      *------ FOR HP ONLY ------*
      *FD  INVPWFIL-O.
      *01  INVPWFIL-REC-O.
      *    05   FILLER                   PIC X(2).
      *    05  INVEMPID                  PIC X(4).
      *    05   FILLER                   PIC X(103).
      *------ FOR HP ONLY ------*
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1            PIC X VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2            PIC X VALUE SPACES.

       01  PASSWORD-FLAG                PIC X VALUE SPACES.
           88  PASSWORD-CORRECT               VALUE "1".
           88  PASSWORD-WRONG                 VALUE "2".

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                   S A V E   A R E A S                   **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       01  PASSWORD-SAVE-AREAS-9.
           05  DAYS-LEFT             PIC 9(2)     VALUE ZERO.
           05  DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED    PIC 9(4)     VALUE ZERO.
           05  PSWD-SUB              PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO  BINARY.
           05  TABLE-SUB             PIC S9(4)    VALUE ZERO  BINARY.

       01  SCREEN-BUFFER             PIC X(2000)   VALUE SPACES.
       01  FORM-NAMES.
           05  PSWD                  PIC X(8)     VALUE "INVPASS1".
       COPY HMSGBUF    IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **           D A T A   E N T R Y   B U F F E R S           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       COPY FUNCTDEF   IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDAT2   IN COPYLIB.
       01  DE-FIELDS-1.
           05  DE-EMPLOYEE-ID       PIC X(4).
           05  DE-PASSWORD          PIC X(8).
           05  DE-NEW-PASSWORD      PIC X(8).
           05  DE-COMMAND-LINE-1    PIC X(79).

       01  FORMFILE.
           05 FORM-FNAME             PIC X(8) VALUE "FINVPASS".
           05  FILLER                PIC X    VALUE ".".
           05 FORM-GNAME.
              10 FORM-GNAME1         PIC X(5) VALUE "FLANG".
              10 FORM-GNAME2         PIC X(3) VALUE SPACES.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(19) VALUE SPACES.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **        U S E R   M E S S A G E   L I T E R A L S        **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

      *
      * YOUR PASSWORD WILL EXPIRE IN {    } DAYS - HIT ENTER TO
      * CONTINUE
      *
       01  PASSWORD-MESSAGE.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(30).
           05  PM-DAYS-LEFT          PIC ZZZ9.
           05  FILLER                PIC X(44).

       COPY TDATECHK IN COPYLIB.
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **       P A S S W O R D   W O R K   A R E A               **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       01  PASSWORD-RCD.
      *------ FOR HP ONLY ------*
      *    05   FILLER               PIC X(2).
      *------ FOR HP ONLY ------*
           05  PW-EMPLOYEE-ID        PIC X(4).
           05  PW-CURRENT-PSWD       PIC X(8).
           05  PW-OLD-PSWD  OCCURS  12  TIMES
                                     PIC X(8).
           05  PW-DATE-ADDED         PIC X(6).
           05  PW-DATE-ADDED-9  REDEFINES  PW-DATE-ADDED
                                     PIC 9(6).
           05  PW-DATE-CHANGED       PIC X(6).
           05  PW-DATE-CHANGED-9  REDEFINES  PW-DATE-CHANGED
                                     PIC 9(6).
           05  PW-DATE-AP-ACT        PIC X(6).
           05  PW-AP-FUNCTION        PIC X.
           05  PW-LENGTH-VALID       PIC 9(2).
           05  PW-AUTHORIZATION-ID   PIC X(4).

       01  PASSWORD-RCD-DUMMY        PIC X(133)   VALUE SPACES.
       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY TSHWRDFM IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DATAB    IN COPYLIB.
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                L I N K A G E   A R E A                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  EMPLOYEE-ID               PIC X(4).

       01  PGM-FUNCTION              PIC X.

       01  SCREEN-PRINT-PARMS.
           05  PRINT-CTL             PIC S9(4) BINARY.
           05  PAGE-CTL              PIC S9(4) BINARY.
           05  SPOOLFIL-OPEN-SW      PIC X.

       01  PASS-SPOOL-PRT-NO         PIC S9(2) BINARY.

       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB  IN COPYLIB.


       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING EMPLOYEE-ID,
                                PGM-FUNCTION,
                                SCREEN-PRINT-PARMS,
                                PASS-SPOOL-PRT-NO,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.
       MAIN-LINE-LOGIC.
           PERFORM  1-HSK  THRU  1-HSK-X.
           PERFORM  6-MAIN THRU  6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 9999-CLOSES.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE LANG-ERCAT-GNAME2 TO FORM-GNAME2.
           PERFORM 9999-OPENS.
           MOVE 1 TO DATE-MODE.
           CALL "TDATECHK" USING DATE-CHECK-AREA.
           MOVE SPACE          TO  DE-FIELDS-1.
           MOVE PSWD           TO  VIEW-NFNAME.
           PERFORM 9999-GETNEXTFORM.
           MOVE 3 TO SRF-MODE.
           PERFORM 9999-RESET-SCREEN.
       1-HSK-X.
           EXIT.

       2100-BLOWUP.
           MOVE "TINVPASS" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-FLDS.

       6-MAIN.
           PERFORM 9999-DO-SCREEN-1.
           SET PASSWORD-WRONG TO TRUE.
           PERFORM UNTIL PASSWORD-CORRECT OR
                         VIEW-LASTKEY EQUAL EXIT-PROGRAM

             IF DE-EMPLOYEE-ID = SPACES

      *
      * EMPLOYEE ID IS REQUIRED
      *
               MOVE   66 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE   58 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD
               MOVE 1 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD

             ELSE

               MOVE DE-EMPLOYEE-ID  TO INVEMPID, EMPLOYEE-ID
               PERFORM 9999-LOCK-INVPWFIL
               READ INVPWFIL-O INTO PASSWORD-RCD
                 INVALID KEY

      *
      * EMPLOYEE ID DOESNT EXIST
      *
                   MOVE  5  TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE 17  TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD
                   MOVE 1 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD
               END-READ
               IF SRF-ERROR-FLD EQUAL 0

                 IF DE-PASSWORD NOT = PW-CURRENT-PSWD

                   MOVE SPACE  TO  DE-PASSWORD

      *
      * ***  INVALID PASSWORD - TRY AGAIN   ***
      *
                   MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  54 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD
                   MOVE 2 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD

                 ELSE

                   IF DE-NEW-PASSWORD NOT = SPACES

                     PERFORM 61-CHANGE-PASSWORD  THRU  61-CP-X

                   ELSE

      *
      * DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED = TODAY - CHANGE
      *
                     IF PW-DATE-CHANGED = SPACE
                       CALL "CDATCALC" USING PW-DATE-ADDED,
                                             DATE-YMD-OUT,
                                             DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED
                     ELSE
                       CALL "CDATCALC" USING PW-DATE-CHANGED,
                                             DATE-YMD-OUT,
                                             DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED
                     END-IF
                     IF DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED > PW-LENGTH-VALID

      *
      * *** YOUR PASSWORD HAS EXPIRED - ENTER A 'NEW' PASSWORD ***
      *
                       MOVE  25 TO LANG-SETNUM
                       MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                       PERFORM 999-CATREAD
                       MOVE 3 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD

                     ELSE

                       IF DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED > ( PW-LENGTH-VALID - 5 )

                         COMPUTE DAYS-LEFT = PW-LENGTH-VALID -
                                             DAYS-SINCE-CHANGED + 1

      *
      * YOUR PASSWORD WILL EXPIRE IN {    } DAYS - HIT ENTER TO
      * CONTINUE
      *
                         MOVE  25 TO LANG-SETNUM
                         MOVE  25 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                         PERFORM 999-CATREAD
                         MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO PASSWORD-MESSAGE
                         MOVE DAYS-LEFT  TO  PM-DAYS-LEFT
                         MOVE PASSWORD-MESSAGE TO MESSAGE-BUFFER
                         MOVE 2 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD
                         PERFORM 9999-DO-SCREEN-1

                       END-IF
                     END-IF
                   END-IF
                 END-IF
               END-IF
             END-IF

             IF SRF-ERROR-FLD EQUAL 0

               SET PASSWORD-CORRECT TO TRUE

             ELSE

               PERFORM 9999-UNLOCK-INVPWFIL
               SET PASSWORD-WRONG TO TRUE
               PERFORM 9999-DO-SCREEN-1

             END-IF

           END-PERFORM.

           IF PASSWORD-CORRECT

      *
      * UPDATE THE ACTIVITY DATE AND FUNCTION
      *
             MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT TO PW-DATE-AP-ACT
             MOVE PGM-FUNCTION TO PW-AP-FUNCTION
             REWRITE INVPWFIL-REC-O FROM PASSWORD-RCD
               INVALID KEY
                 MOVE DE-EMPLOYEE-ID  TO  BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
                 GO TO  2100-BLOWUP
             END-REWRITE
             PERFORM 9999-UNLOCK-INVPWFIL

           END-IF.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-CHANGE-PASSWORD.
           MOVE ZEROS          TO  PSWD-SUB,
                                   TABLE-SUB.
           IF DE-NEW-PASSWORD = PW-CURRENT-PSWD
      *    *** THE NEW PASSWORD MUST BE DIFFERENT FROM THE CURRENT PASSWORD **
               MOVE  20 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  16 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD
               MOVE 3 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD
               GO TO  61-CP-X.

       61-VALIDATE-LOOP.
           ADD +1  TO  PSWD-SUB.

           IF PSWD-SUB > 12  OR
              PW-OLD-PSWD (PSWD-SUB) = SPACE
               MOVE +12  TO  PSWD-SUB
               MOVE +13  TO  TABLE-SUB
               GO TO  61-UPDT-OPW-TABLE.

           IF DE-NEW-PASSWORD = PW-OLD-PSWD (PSWD-SUB)
      *    ** THIS PASSWORD HAS BEEN PREVIOUSLY USED - PLEASE SELECT ANOTHER **
               MOVE  20 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  17 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD
               MOVE 3 TO SRF-ERROR-FLD
               GO TO  61-CP-X
           ELSE
               GO TO  61-VALIDATE-LOOP.

       61-UPDT-OPW-TABLE.
           SUBTRACT +1  FROM  PSWD-SUB.
           SUBTRACT +1  FROM  TABLE-SUB.

           IF TABLE-SUB = 1
               GO TO  61-UPDATE-CURRENT-PSWD.

           MOVE PW-OLD-PSWD (PSWD-SUB)  TO  PW-OLD-PSWD (TABLE-SUB).
           GO TO  61-UPDT-OPW-TABLE.

       61-UPDATE-CURRENT-PSWD.
           MOVE PW-CURRENT-PSWD        TO  PW-OLD-PSWD (TABLE-SUB).
           MOVE DE-NEW-PASSWORD        TO  PW-CURRENT-PSWD.
           MOVE DATE-YMD-OUT           TO  PW-DATE-CHANGED.

       61-CP-X.
           EXIT.

       9999-LOCK-INVPWFIL.
       9999-UNLOCK-INVPWFIL.
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO INVEMPID.
           START INVPWFIL-O KEY > INVEMPID
             INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.
       9999-OPENS.
           OPEN I-O INVPWFIL-O, DISPLAY-FILE.
       9999-CLOSES.
           CLOSE INVPWFIL-O, DISPLAY-FILE.
       COPY HCATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY SCRNCALL IN COPYLIB.
       COPY SCRNCL1  IN COPYLIB.
